<title>MEXICO: Mexico oil/gas reserves good for 43 yrs - gov't.</title>
<headline>Mexico oil/gas reserves good for 43 yrs - gov't.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico has oil and gas reserves as of the beginning of this year for another 43 years at current extraction rates, Energy Minister Jesus Reyes Heroles said Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Based on the current rates of extraction of hydrocarbons, which is 1.45 billion barrels per year, at the start of the year Mexico had reserves for 43 years,&quot; Reyes Heroles told legislators.</p>
<p>--Jacqueline Lerma, Mexico City newsroom 525 7289701</p>
